cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this guide, please cite it as below."
title: "Causal Uplift Targeting Guide"
abstract: "A practical guide for community lenders (CDFIs, community development credit unions, community banks, and loan funds) to measure and target the incremental effect of outreach: randomized test design, lift with intervals, segment-level lift with shrinkage, when uplift models are worth it, budget allocation, and target-market reach checks, with a spreadsheet calculator and a worked example on synthetic data."
